# Copy this file to .npmrc (gitignored, never commit real tokens) and fill in
# a GitHub Personal Access Token with `read:packages` scope on the
# melchi45/rtsp-over-websocket repo — @melchi45/rtsp-over-websocket is
# published to GitHub Packages, which always requires authentication for
# `npm install`, even for public repos (unlike the default npmjs.com registry).
@melchi45:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=YOUR_GITHUB_PAT_WITH_READ_PACKAGES_SCOPE
